  "response_text": "Here's a breakdown of your requests:\n\n### 1. **Tasks I Can Help You With**\nI can assist you with a wide range of tasks, including but not limited to:\n   - **Email Management**:\n     - Sending, reading, searching, and deleting emails.\n     - Managing drafts, sent items, and unread emails.\n     - Searching contacts by name or email.\n   - **Calendar Management**:\n     - Scheduling, rescheduling, or canceling events.\n     - Adding participants to events.\n     - Searching and listing calendar events.\n   - **File Management**:\n     - Creating, searching, listing, or deleting files in your cloud drive.\n     - Sharing files with others.\n     - Appending content to files.\n   - **General Productivity**:\n     - Keeping track of deadlines, reminders, or tasks.\n     - Organizing and retrieving information.\n\n---\n\n### 2. **List of Your Items (Most Recent to Oldest)**\nThe items you have can include emails, calendar events, and files. Please specify which category you'd like me to list:\n   - **Emails** (received, sent, drafts, or unread).\n   - **Calendar Events** (for a specific date or all).\n   - **Files** (in your cloud drive).\n\nLet me know which category to focus on, and I'll retrieve the most recent items for you.\n\n---\n\n### 3. **File Types I Can Work With**\nI can work with a variety of file types, including but not limited to:\n   - **Text files** (.txt, .md, etc.).\n   - **Document files** (.docx, .pdf, etc.).\n   - **Spreadsheets** (.xlsx, .csv, etc.).\n   - **Presentations** (.pptx, etc.).\n   - **Code files** (.py, .js, .html, etc.).\n   - **Configuration files** (.json, .yaml, etc.).\n\nIf you have specific files in mind, you can ask me to search or list them for you.\n\n---\n\nLet me know how you'd like to proceed!",
